{"id":"1f0d77daa9699532","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-two-low-degree-generators.md","title":"两个固定低 c.e. 度覆盖所有 c.e. 分裂","display":"thm-two-low-degree-generators — 两个固定低 c.e. 度覆盖所有 c.e. 分裂","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-two-low-degree-generators","aliases":["20-thm-two-low-degree-generators"],"display":"thm-two-low-degree-generators — 两个固定低 c.e. 度覆盖所有 c.e. 分裂","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 7.6.5","source_printed_pages":[162],"source_pdf_pages":[196],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]","[[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]","[[20-df-halt]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-df-low-high]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-two-low-degree-generators"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-two-low-degree-generators</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-two-low-degree-generators — 两个固定低 c.e. 度覆盖所有 c.e. 分裂"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 7.6.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>162</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>196</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" href=\"?note=9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting\">20-thm-sacks-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" href=\"?note=2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" title=\"20-df-halt\">20-df-halt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" href=\"?note=9a7da25a4fbbc78c\" title=\"20-thm-sacks-splitting\">20-thm-sacks-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" href=\"?note=2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" title=\"20-df-halt\">20-df-halt</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}two\\text{-}low\\text{-}degree\\text{-}generators}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ \\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ \\exists\\mathbf b_0,\\mathbf b_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf b_0\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\mathbf b_1\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf c=\\mathbf b_0\\vee\\mathbf b_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}two\\text{-}low\\text{-}degree\\text{-}generators}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ \\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ \\exists\\mathbf b_0,\\mathbf b_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf b_0\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\mathbf b_1\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf c=\\mathbf b_0\\vee\\mathbf b_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 Sacks 定理把本目录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:x\\in W_e\\}\">\\(H=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:x\\in W_e\\}\\)</span> 分成两个低 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1\">\\(A_0,A_1\\)</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\in\\mathbf c\">\\(W_e\\in\\mathbf c\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i=\\{x:\\langle e,x\\rangle\\in A_i\\}\">\\(B_i=\\{x:\\langle e,x\\rangle\\in A_i\\}\\)</span>。列提取是有效归约，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\le_TA_i\">\\(B_i\\le_TA_i\\)</span>；两者 c.e.、不交，且并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>，所以不交分裂命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\equiv_TB_0\\oplus B_1\">\\(W_e\\equiv_TB_0\\oplus B_1\\)</span>。取其度即可。还可由跳跃单调性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\">\\(B_i\\)</span> 低，但断言不需要额外加入此条件。原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span> 的坐标次序与本目录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 相反，证明已统一改用本目录次序。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 7.6.5；印刷页 162；PDF 第 196 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","leve